{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_title", "source_sha256": "ceacf2be70ca2b3c02206b00ad0d859d432aa02b8d92481c63d51c4d31129ca2", "ja": "そして、輝く君であれ", "zh": "愿你成为闪耀的自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_synopsis", "source_sha256": "88cb9c03c1c1d187a9629b2e457824e6d68bc3046a439bd51fe1448394f4a395", "ja": "苦手だった歌を褒められるようになり、新曲\nお披露目公演を前に上機嫌な歩。だが兄が\n公演を観にくる事になると、様子が一変。\n「何故アイドルになったのか」。その言葉に\n思いを新たにした歩は、改めて決意する。", "zh": "曾经不擅长的歌唱得到了夸奖，在新歌\n亮相公演前，步的心情非常好。然而当得知\n哥哥要来看公演后，她的态度却为之一变。\n“为什么成为了偶像呢”。因这句话而重新\n坚定了心意的步，再一次下定了决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32be789d8266271ece193e2ccbd5e33c67d5bf6d6e7f543371f0d5ccc629a300", "ja": "（次の定期公演のレッスンが始まった。が、新曲を\nお披露目する予定の、歩の様子が少し気になる……）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演的练习开始了。不过，预定在公演上首次演唱新歌的步，看起来有些让人在意……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3d98e5fb3ce3f6e2f357e4a4f13c12dda4280285084c3066d4126e6dc94bbaba", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……。\n……あー、ダメ！　これじゃ全然ダメだ～！", "zh": "一、二、三、四……。\n……啊——不行！这样完全不行啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "715d8a0f922b80e8074a492682fd56e7122849dd26e83d2ecdf730639b82f113", "ja": "そうか？　初日にしては\nよくできてる方だと思うけど。", "zh": "是吗？不过以第一天来说，\n我觉得已经做得很好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cc8c67ca49d3ad11b5312b0926fa07d134cef66bb95078f334a72bcda74ef71", "ja": "いやいや、全然だよ！　体が全く動いてないもん。\nそのせいで、ステップのキレも悪いし。", "zh": "不不不，完全不行！身体根本没动起来。\n所以，脚步也不够利落。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "31f8e9f19fd4bdf2c5229aff85113c2ee3a8a6f3032d68dd24aed7c90dcd6d8e", "ja": "これじゃ、兄貴に呆れられちゃう。\nとりあえず、今のとこ、もう一回復習して……。", "zh": "这样下去，会被哥哥嫌弃的。\n总之，先把刚才的部分再复习一遍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "894aeb504d23701929efab1a31c19d29d7261241442286ddbd78c686f4077ec2", "ja": "（お兄さんが観に来る事が決まってから、\n歩は肩に力が入りすぎてる気がするな。ここは……）", "zh": "（自从决定哥哥要来看演出后，步好像就太过紧张了。这里该……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "35df06f566e73e6353b76eabcdc5e7ba4f8b3405e10c66494f1ca55e459e8d1d", "ja": "歩さん、すこし飛ばし過ぎではありませんか～？\nレッスン初日ですよ～？", "zh": "步小姐，是不是有点太拼命了呀～？\n今天可是上课第一天哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4b3c0776447a35ff23e6f005fcb5ee8dcaca80b4eea41c6cce2c16f9f9b5a3f", "ja": "ありがとう、朋花。でも、こんなんじゃダメなんだよ。\nあの兄貴を納得させるには……。", "zh": "谢谢你，朋花。不过，这样还不行。\n要让那个大哥心服口服的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "696d12a37cd1555027a32f576ae48aa33e2f63e4d52e0fd5969c005762eff679", "ja": "歩さん……どうしてそこまで、\nお兄さんを気にするんですか～？", "zh": "步小姐……为什么会这么在意自己的哥哥呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "66b4af76eaad71b32d22057393f8bb843060a7445b677bfee203731a59cd9273", "ja": "やっぱりきょうだいというのは、\n特別に感じるものなんでしょうか～。", "zh": "兄弟姐妹果然是会让人觉得特别的存在吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f73d36537dcf0d8a1b4ba2dce932909106f196f88d323355c2daedb3ab7fc7f3", "ja": "特別ってことはないけど、すごいとは思ってるよ。\n尊敬してるし、憧れて……って、なんか恥ずかしいな。", "zh": "虽然也没觉得有什么特别的，但确实很厉害。\n我很尊敬他，也很憧憬他……啊，这么说还真有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae54281273396110b869fd708c0e9e816f37bf8ac322bdb3652f0bd49863e441", "ja": "そういえばアタシ、歩のお兄さんが何してる人か、\nちゃんと聞いたことなかったかも。", "zh": "说起来，我好像还没好好问过，步的哥哥是做什么工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e708437e1c9b2bf3dc8f56031ffeb1661dd956d12fa3f935814ccf91a20318c7", "ja": "兄貴は、アメリカで振付師をやってるんだ。アタシ\nなんか比べ物にならないくらい、ダンスが上手くてさ。", "zh": "我哥在美国当编舞师。舞跳得比我厉害多了，根本不是我能比的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "70ca6d25542b29fa1f05f9b896b34e0a01d17ff2cd606bc368b5d182433fc17c", "ja": "アタシがダンスを始めたのも、最初は兄貴の影響！\n家で練習してるのをよくマネしてたんだよね。", "zh": "我开始跳舞，也是最初受哥哥的影响！以前经常在家里模仿他练习来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "41c977038b3f11320ec0c13013d439691b6a5944c562c80cd977939c0506ebef", "ja": "前にもそう言ってたな、歩。\nアメリカに留学したのも、お兄さんが先だって。", "zh": "之前你也这么说过呢，步。就连去美国留学，也是你哥哥先去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a132ab7201d4f12897c995c30d31f7879deaf2c508e022521aff9d0dd991284d", "ja": "イエス！　アタシも、留学中は兄貴のアパートに\n転がりこんでたしね。やっぱ、影響は大きいよ。", "zh": "没错！我留学的时候也是住进了我哥的公寓。果然，受到的影响很大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "e71279416900701984861ac552433bb0491c685414e59aa4b962145a6b67cca0", "ja": "そうですか……歩さんにとって、\nお兄さんは、とても大きな存在なんですね～。", "zh": "这样啊……对步来说，哥哥是非常重要的存在呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c1edb147d60fae54c471f321ca9db5c3a4880ffa4c774b0171926507c3d40780", "ja": "え、結局そこに落ち着くの？\nまあ確かに、意識してるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "诶，结果还是归结到那里去了吗？\n不过确实，我想我是有意识在意他的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "2670a2ecaae34de9df630bad0e6f8e9d0d9753a6199b81bb1272a6a94a9cb45e", "ja": "真美にはわかるよ、あゆあゆの気持ち……\n真美だって、亜美には絶対絶対負けたくないし？", "zh": "真美能理解步步的心情……\n真美也绝对绝对不想输给亚美嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "4544c58a1f15f51bd00d07d791e94eca21c0be36dfb09cb8550bd732b50f20f8", "ja": "なるほど～。つまりきょうだいとは、\n身近なライバルでもあるんですな～。", "zh": "原来如此～也就是说，兄弟姐妹也是身边的竞争对手呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7d1512d71e4250a2c036b80761ce85e95d6fa996e436f30eecda670929d49322", "ja": "ライバル……そうなのかな？　兄貴とアタシじゃ\nそもそもレベルが違うし、どう思ってるかも……。", "zh": "对手……是这样吗？我和我哥本来就不是一个水平，他是怎么想的……gripping?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f73576890975c66a6b9215c0895ae8e60a6902f2246b6822cb032c6bb3782f7", "ja": "留学中も、「お前は日本に帰ったほうがいいかもな」\nとか言われちゃったしさ！　あは、あはは……。", "zh": "留学期间，他还说过：“你还是回日本比较好吧。”之类的话！啊哈，啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d0625207a1bcd1746ae2ba58858eb9e39ec669b03a89d557bc37790e6d0267a5", "ja": "歩……。", "zh": "步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14c0bae3f9b62d6196e7ed3ff385285bd489999c400cdd6f00a103e09719f2d5", "ja": "多分、「お前が留学するなんて、100年早い！」\nって思われてたんじゃないかな？", "zh": "他们大概是这么想的吧：“你想出国留学，还早了100年呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e243514d2cfb9a74919bf4408e1371e164765d721fd478656b873d4eeaf6075", "ja": "でも、だからこそ、がんばりたいんだ！\nあの頃のアタシとは違うんだってこと……。", "zh": "不过，正因如此，我才更想努力啊！我想证明，现在的我已经和那时候不一样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1025_p", "source_sha256": "051c4047fea22683e59e81100125fe2410aa28057773ecab4849cc1bc5559b05", "ja": "歩……わかったよ。\nけど、あまり無理はしないようにな。", "zh": "步……我知道了。\n不过，也别太勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "24dcff251bd0bbebc05bd52bb16a7d45236868b8799e8a6b68e85051b489893b", "ja": "うん！　サンキュー、{$P$}！\nあとすこしだけ、自主練して帰るよ！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我再自主练习一会儿就回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ee5b8bd1be7889527061072ae0dc5f44881c6ea4c8889355a14cb3744b28c773", "ja": "（歩が、お兄さんにこだわる理由はわかった。\n結果を見せたいという気持ちもわかる……）", "zh": "（我明白步为什么那么在意哥哥了。\n我也明白她想让他看到成果的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c21bf1047ca41460d19523058355be13ffdbe171d48a80d66930a8e3896b5de4", "ja": "（とはいえ、オーバーワークは禁物だ。\n歩が飛ばし過ぎないよう、注意して見ていよう）", "zh": "（话虽如此，可不能过度劳累。要注意看着，别让步冲过头了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1029_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "9a26b60f0cf79676dec7a25136258a95e0a4558ca396faa81ae397153500aa51", "ja": "いけっ、がんばれ！　最後は……\nブレーンバスター、決まった～～～っ！！", "zh": "上啊，加油！最后是……\n脑壳重摔，成功——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "379b33a48d348f2a156ac9ab59b2c9e83a1c60c2c6f4656db110ad592322d39c", "ja": "いい試合でしたな～。\nタイトルマッチ、とても熱い展開でした～。", "zh": "真是一场精彩的比赛啊～。\n冠军争夺赛的展开实在太激烈了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "a93bad09d305d2a5769324a2a44edc49d2927e2834c069a9532a919512df0c2b", "ja": "うん！　ノリーの解説付きで見るプロレス、\nメチャ面白かったー。また見ようね！", "zh": "嗯！有诺莉解说的职业摔角比赛，超级有意思——下次再一起看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1033_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8c68fcbb66775598072c5f927507ea92ff1ca11f7d44b520ed9cf55c3512e508", "ja": "お疲れさまー……あれ？\nみんな、まだいたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了——……咦？\n大家还在啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "a312a73c4925fcaef971964f0ad39cccdc9eaeb794d97b611158ac618ae9f1d5", "ja": "歩さん、お疲れさまです～。\nみんなで、プロレスを見てたんですよ～。", "zh": "步，辛苦啦～  \n我们刚才在一起看职业摔角呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1036_012mam", "source_sha256": "a3c8e02f63171ae7b41a6e9fe8e0987358b22295201013aecb9713b7cdc5da12", "ja": "鍛えられた肉体同士のぶつかり稽古……\n男のマロンだよね～。", "zh": "锻炼有素的肉体彼此碰撞的训练……这就是男人的浪漫啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b996b9b6c7e7fca94bb5103ee9ca75b4bab3149b5a4d759bb610bf9f45e0ccae", "ja": "いやぶつかり稽古じゃ相撲だし、\nそれを言うならロマンじゃ……まあいいけど。", "zh": "不对，碰撞对练那是相扑吧，\n而且那应该叫男人的浪漫才……嘛，也无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1038_announcer", "source_sha256": "69b78afb46d93e80cad6d194a406269daf3779769dca7ed11f0d3c1f3dc52138", "ja": "『続きましては、イベント情報です！　いよいよ\n来週、国内最大級のダンス大会が開催されます！』", "zh": "接下来是活动信息！备受期待的\n全国最大规模舞蹈大赛将于下周举办！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1039_announcer", "source_sha256": "ef96bc3a0019ab04e6127424c52ca04c458160dfdaa18eb89d049251731fa033", "ja": "『本日は、ゲスト審査員としてアメリカから帰国された\n振付師の舞浜さんにお越しいただきました！』", "zh": "『今天，我们邀请到了从美国回国、担任特邀评委的舞蹈老师舞滨小姐！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "6a26a18defe030e7f2789eefcfd45c22606107b89fa1afa865dba6df825ce342", "ja": "あれ、この人もマイハマさん？\nひょっとして、ダンサーに多い苗字とか？", "zh": "咦，这个人也是舞滨小姐？难道说，这是舞者中很常见的姓氏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fb801d5a834844f582b3ab5e7972acdf61182edea40c54e2d56aec34a35ab33e", "ja": "いや、ダンサーに多い苗字って何？\nっていうかそれ、アタシの兄貴だから。", "zh": "不是，你说的什么舞者常见姓氏啊？\n再说了，那是我哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "044ec11161c18e5617fd0cb04fcbc86bd78c42ca2a994f196e912247f49be464", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ。歩の……", "zh": "哦——原来是这样。步的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "f8c96312f463cff3d1ca077a41ff87ab67e2fd0ef2acc8580f35aaef477eb64d", "ja": "って、ええーっ！！　ダンス大会のゲスト審査員！？\nなんか、想像してたよりすごいんだけど！？", "zh": "等等，诶——！！舞蹈大赛的特邀评委！？\n感觉比我想象的还厉害啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "83b263e9e1a722b8b675278f0c7592f6fb45377f21e5ad03641828f2f89842eb", "ja": "なんか、テロップ出てるよ！\nシン……シン？　なんて読むの、あゆあゆ！", "zh": "好像有字幕出来了！\n新……新？怎么读啊，步步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a5ad1cf0c9ecd832afdff644010c12f4365274184e3c4d90c196e103a07f5b6f", "ja": "『新進気鋭、日本を代表する若手振付師』だって。\n流石に、ちょっと盛ってる気もするけど……。", "zh": "上面写着：“锐意进取、代表日本的年轻编舞师”。\n不过说实话，我觉得多少还是有点夸张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "a146d00e5189050dc11e554e10fb599cd70f3a511de63288513c13e13e5fd4e8", "ja": "けど、こうしてコメンテーターとして呼ばれるくらい、\n注目されている方なんですね～。", "zh": "不过，能像这样被邀请来担任评论员，看来确实是位备受瞩目的人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1048_announcer", "source_sha256": "a606a0f89689fb227472fbc9ba20f024e96238e289f387f71c140f829f8e585b", "ja": "『舞浜さん。今大会以外で、\n注目している日本のダンサーはいますか？』", "zh": "“舞滨小姐，除了本次大赛之外，\n还有关注的日本舞者吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1049_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "7d39db5b6f45ea4407f086d5b7b50e6ec25427ce06e983263a1e9a3bce46823d", "ja": "『そうですね、最近海外でも活躍している、\nあの人ですとか……』", "zh": "『是啊，比如最近在海外也很活跃的\n那位……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1050_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "32f077610afdb4b68c33225e4d718661bf7b9158fa1082ac4fee7cc1a4c289f0", "ja": "『あとはアイドルで、765プロの舞浜歩にも\n注目しています。僕の妹なんですけど』", "zh": "『还有就是偶像方面，我也很关注765事务所的\n舞滨步。虽然是我的妹妹就是了』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1051_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b15f0c3c41a2b4936680ec001c0a44d91b9e133486b81d693359b12a43048934", "ja": "…………へっ！？", "zh": "…………诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1052_012mam", "source_sha256": "5031b97fb8491cb4d831af563087127e8121ce2232a62c19a4d37cd22846a124", "ja": "え！？　あゆあゆの兄ちゃん、\n今、あゆあゆの名前言った！？", "zh": "诶！？步步的哥哥，\n刚才是不是叫了步步的名字！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "87801e3b209ceec7525609ecd2f150efa69ed5f12cdcce779e24ac17a02016b2", "ja": "あら……では次の定期公演は、\n歩さんに注目が集まること間違いなしですね～。", "zh": "哎呀……那么在下次的定期公演上，\n大家一定会聚焦在步女士身上呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1055_031tom", "source_sha256": "c37b8dbb7e9ca978b11a65744f152d362958481120932dd9a23abd08d4bffe0b", "ja": "歩さん～？", "zh": "步小姐～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1056_034ayu", "source_sha256": "08291f7263a8063862a94f2d100a0873fe9ab985f7b3e5ff31a87f465ed92f57", "ja": "あ……アタシ、ちょっと走ってくるっ！", "zh": "啊……我去跑一会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1057_043nor", "source_sha256": "14ef412eb116e8bad25b35e940cbeb12944c01f0f0bf04250365259ffb3703e6", "ja": "えっ、走ってくるって……今から！？\nちょっと、歩ー！", "zh": "诶，跑一趟是说……现在就去！？\n等等，步——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1058_se", "source_sha256": "b7d769a933cc8cb3d4f3dc26614c33cd76e85fd1cebd43fb943338373783a379", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "嘎啦嘎啦，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1059_p", "source_sha256": "d190d6461978a0bbb83f8f1e1a87bfb446ab7ba431a1b7cbd87b7b804c020124", "ja": "あ、歩。ちょうどよかった、ライブの\n演出の件で、少し相談したいんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，舞。来得正好，我想就演唱会的演出和你商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1060_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1e8ee86570180fe785273de72f07208b1310b402ea159358161e3b2903b55c42", "ja": "{$P$}、ごめん！\nまた後でーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，抱歉！\n待会儿再聊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1061_p", "source_sha256": "9740e4bea4ab7b0c8c743fec70ac6a391c8dbd094ec63726deb0c953a9a26d82", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ、わかった……？", "zh": "欸？啊，啊啊，知道了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1062_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1063_p", "source_sha256": "bf8b2d64a55ee320d926dab90088c972a2de176daad6925ad2ffc7478baa7205", "ja": "お疲れさま……みんな、まだいたんだな。今、歩が\nすごい勢いで出て行ったけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了……大家还在啊。刚才步气势汹汹地出去了，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1064_012mam", "source_sha256": "4fc70d18a6f58b2b98bf0e45f4cd87b557f6141f9910adccfca8468bfc9fb352", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃん！\n聞いてよ、タイヘンなんだよ～！", "zh": "啊，哥！\n你听我说嘛，出大事了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1066_p", "source_sha256": "adce7b7f906b6e4e25c8e6f47cd27f5f1840da743823f2bd6c524efdad0111fc", "ja": "そんな事が……。", "zh": "居然会有这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1067_043nor", "source_sha256": "08e5a5cbf1812fe3f0f63b1711511fb7f374e75f09595a11ee22646882951f0e", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。歩、大丈夫かな？\nレッスンの時から、お兄さんのこと気にしてるし……。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。步没事吧？从练习的时候开始，她就一直在意哥哥的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1068_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e1caa5ca4a41fdabe1068c0390f077cbcba6e29817d8b0357fad61dbfb0b4c4", "ja": "さっきので、余計にプレッシャー感じて、\n悩んだりしてないといいんだけど。", "zh": "希望刚才那件事没有让她感到更大的压力，开始烦恼什么的就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1069_p", "source_sha256": "bc81c2a3ac121bda27daac70a13a14525bc98a40f260ae1ca2b733b84a886480", "ja": "わかった。歩には、俺が話すから……\nありがとう、みんな。", "zh": "我知道了。步那边，我来跟她说……\n谢谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1070_p", "source_sha256": "7ffc199d7af8b8ed344ef8bab45aa5958efdb9196ed52e3a680d1d121899bb7e", "ja": "（走れそうな場所を探していると、歩を見つけた。\nあの様子だと、ずっと走ってたみたいだな……）", "zh": "（寻找适合奔跑的地方时，我发现了步。看她那个样子，似乎一直都在跑啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1071_034ayu", "source_sha256": "466681955a37d27069a4bdf89f9802d640a10319d2bc52b840956c9a4a3168bc", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……もっと、集中しないと……。\n雑念を捨てて……も、もう一本……！", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……得更加集中精神才行……\n抛开杂念……再、再跑一组……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1072_p", "source_sha256": "34ac3725867385b5b81c31a8d1698bce913dc3ca06d1bc9d33c8183989b9438f", "ja": "歩、ストップ！　オーバーワークだ。\n今日はもう、これ以上練習はさせられない。", "zh": "歩，停下！练过头了。\n今天已经不能再让你继续练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1073_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aecfd057f458eb7e68fe2298befc1ad1046024ff9a433e3e5fefef40ae7b2902", "ja": "止めないでよ、{$P$}！\nだって今のアタシじゃ、全然ダメなんだよ！", "zh": "别拦着我啊，{$P$}！\n因为现在的我，根本就不行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1074_034ayu", "source_sha256": "000504931b451b5d5603ed8dcafade3b76abe15e3818f6982ec15e3c84f973d0", "ja": "もっと練習しないと、兄貴を越えられない。\n今のままじゃ、ステージにはとても……。", "zh": "要是不多加练习，我就超越不了我哥。\n以现在的水平，根本就没法站上舞台……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1075_p", "source_sha256": "cef4276713f4c3b3210aa9b2bda0b9a0228f40822d664e23e7a55b87137f6d98", "ja": "お兄さんの発言で、注目度が上がったからか？\n頑張りたいと思うのは当然だと思うけど……。", "zh": "是因为哥哥的发言，让关注度提高了吗？\n想要努力也是理所当然的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1076_p", "source_sha256": "c1282227c70d9a300deede71120a41f912ef4638e47f1a966c24c93fc18a24ea", "ja": "でもその前に……ひとつ、聞いてもいいか？\n歩は、誰のために公演をやるんだ？", "zh": "不过在那之前……我能先问你一件事吗？\n步是为了谁举办公演的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1077_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1078_p", "source_sha256": "615cc418fd8e922491c3b96b1000141386d896b2ba63e04c6028160f322040ae", "ja": "レッスンして、最高のパフォーマンスをする。\nそれはアイドルとして、すごく正しい事だ。", "zh": "进行训练，拿出最棒的表现。\n这对偶像来说，是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1079_p", "source_sha256": "923afec8a981b8e853d518cc3c128148b340d80b16dcbb9ddcf1b9b77af2c069", "ja": "けどステージは、見てくれるお客さんがいて、\n初めて成り立つものだ。違うか？", "zh": "但是，舞台上有愿意观看的客人，才能真正成立。不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1081_p", "source_sha256": "f59bf472081538df7856e85cbb8f63fc89976f6eaced96cef6df194a43d1751f", "ja": "歩のパフォーマンスが物足りないなんて、\n俺もみんなも、思っていない。", "zh": "我和大家都不觉得，步的表演有什么不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1082_p", "source_sha256": "200c11e2d7e4d3e5f19b8b22e4729203ce5745ea6671cb7ad2fc91e8b3681c7b", "ja": "きっと、お客さんもそうだと思う。", "zh": "我想，客人们肯定也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1083_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b6f3237665503662a21656786776a4c4e158f11e4a8e6131ccfae112ea4dfc89", "ja": "{$P$}。アタシ……。", "zh": "{$P$}。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1084_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c3bdf295cfee0489210e098a99a43f60e193fe78e5efd88c058c68ddc4da1ef7", "ja": "アタシ……自分が思ってたよりも、\n兄貴に言われたこと、気にしてたみたいだ……。", "zh": "我……好像比自己想的还要在意哥哥说过的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1085_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1086_034ayu", "source_sha256": "51ff68807e28379a5ba50a1c5a61e3e5901dd2efc8c8dff93e988b2002fcab34", "ja": "多分、ショックで、悔しくて……\n兄貴のこと、なんとか見返してやりたくて……。", "zh": "大概是打击太大，觉得很不甘心……\n一心想着怎么也得让我哥刮目相看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1087_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b1ad6525a316ca71a6a78f7b3bffb2a6f807a3f5d6d8c775de5cc7dbdba18dd", "ja": "自分でも気づかないうちに、兄貴に認めてもらう\nためだけに、がんばるようになってたのかな……。", "zh": "我是不是在自己都没察觉到的时候，变成了只为了得到哥哥的认可而努力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1088_p", "source_sha256": "f21edc37749dfec06da0e2319ea9365199f21a61296e384352908bfeaa02dae3", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。……尊敬している人に\n言われたんだから、ショックなのは仕方がないよ。", "zh": "也许吧……毕竟是被自己尊敬的人那样说，受到打击也是没办法的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1089_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fd19ce832bdf90c81d44e70b3e90712ce213fbcb2712b5d3376840a08a2c8e02", "ja": "でも、でもさ。だとしたらアタシは、\n何のためにアイドルになったのかな？", "zh": "可是，可是啊。要是那样的话，我到底是为了什么才成为偶像的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1090_034ayu", "source_sha256": "67aabe380f744bb8c298d63b74b7e0724bd8873e727715d8ed95078ff60d14f5", "ja": "こんな中途半端な気持ちで……アタシなんかが、\nアイドル、やってていいのかな……。", "zh": "怀着这样半吊子的心情……我这种人，\n真的可以继续当偶像吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1091_p", "source_sha256": "d97f99112d6e0d7ba1f78fba3be3242b7bcc97d3d2b20f294e3a85811e13570a", "ja": "何のために、か。……きっかけは、お兄さんを\n見返してやりたいという気持ちだったかもしれない。", "zh": "说到底是为了什么吗……或许最初的契机，是想让哥哥对我刮目相看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1092_p", "source_sha256": "999149b6f6ad0e6858a9a220f0973b16ddbd043408e6bacb36b5361a762ba0fe", "ja": "けど歩は、ステージに立つ事がイヤだったか？", "zh": "可是，步真的讨厌站上舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1093_p", "source_sha256": "67c1148fc306fecbd99d635ff26a78e8f91e162229ca34aa18965b862bef87a5", "ja": "今までだって、どんなに苦しくたって、\n苦手な歌のレッスンも、頑張ってきたじゃないか。", "zh": "直到现在，不管有多辛苦，你不也一直努力坚持着不擅长的歌唱训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1095_p", "source_sha256": "cf9b20c92648d26f7006e39365f65fc71a3d8c4eee7b81ba51edd088da62c02f", "ja": "どうして、アイドルになったのか。\n今まで、アイドルを続けて来られたのか……。", "zh": "为什么会成为偶像。\n又为什么能一直坚持做偶像到现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1096_p", "source_sha256": "423cd4dd0ddd6f657fd64eebf5079a51eb6725b5c916ad2aaa25c32123ae5372", "ja": "その答えは、歩だけが持ってるはずだよ。", "zh": "那个答案，应该只有步自己知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1097_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4ab8c150709c6dcebcb4eed889ae77d1edee6bcb2d1c3ab9fe37a0582e07948", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。アタシ、\nステージに立つのがイヤだなんて、思ったことない。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。人家从没想过，自己会讨厌站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1098_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0f162b92818418665feaf62376ecbf285d344b269e9ab379b0d3aa6b7d98626a", "ja": "そりゃ、失敗することもあったけど。でも、\nファンのみんなは、いつだって応援してくれてさ……。", "zh": "虽然也有过失败的时候。但是，粉丝们无论何时都会为我加油……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1099_034ayu", "source_sha256": "644b7953cc61c30de9790fab68ef9d50626fde45284726669b790ecb545dd0d5", "ja": "楽しそうなみんなの顔を見ると、うれしくて……。\n『アイドルって、ホントすごいな』って……。", "zh": "看到大家开心的表情，我就觉得好高兴……。\n“偶像真的很厉害啊”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1100_p", "source_sha256": "36a94f365c072a350322c568757e5b9d505495e1a178c1524123206250c2ebe6", "ja": "そうだな。アイドルは、人を笑顔にできる。\nそれは本当に、すごい事なんだよ。", "zh": "是啊。偶像能让人露出笑容。\n那确实是一件非常了不起的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1101_p", "source_sha256": "a9353ffe02e6e2ead00ea1d55adaa0d0182f9e43b521323290e3334a9e360fac", "ja": "お兄さんへの悔しさを、捨てろとは言わない。\nただ、これだけは忘れないで欲しい。", "zh": "我不是要你丢掉对哥哥的不甘。\n只是，希望你唯独不要忘记这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1102_p", "source_sha256": "2bdccab8581448ae49140ba34f67ab541039b27971b51f77e88af6bb074d76d1", "ja": "『舞浜歩はアイドルだ』って事をな！", "zh": "别忘了，『舞滨步是偶像』这件事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1103_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5e1de24a50f4f3f71a7d10453d58d868bb5d8a1cb0828a1ea429095baffcf7c9", "ja": "……うんっ！\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "……嗯！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1104_034ayu", "source_sha256": "11e85da3fe32026fc7d400007c05140d08011274df5c333c647f36944f97e4e5", "ja": "アタシ、がんばるよ。がんばって……\n観に来てくれたみんなを、笑顔にしてみせる！", "zh": "我会努力的。努力让……\n专程来看演出的大家都露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1105_p", "source_sha256": "fb545b843a86fc016d82022a76e826a61e4e1b5e9b8407956bc7a8fa9d76f73c", "ja": "ああ！　頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊！拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_093_1106_p", "source_sha256": "121ea6fecab023814c0ce62bc3e71681347079dd3e91a6ce245f2ff723c0a179", "ja": "（歩の目には、涙が滲んでいるように見えた。\n……大丈夫。これまでだって、頑張ってきたんだ！）", "zh": "（看起来，步的眼中泛起了泪光。\n……没事的。她一直以来都努力走到现在了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
